    "sub": "A team of researchers at NASA's Goddard Space Flight Center has developed a new instrument designed to eliminate blind spots between lines of lidar data on Earth's surface. Built.",
    "sub_pt": "A team of researchers at NASA's Goddard Space Flight Center has developed a new instrument designed to eliminate blind spots between lines of lidar data on Earth's surface. Built.",
